IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aal-rules`

-- Advance Australia Logo Protection Act 1984 (Cth) — the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

GIVEN g IS A `Dealing`, lic IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Logo case`
`a trader` g `licensed` lic `on` d MEANS `Logo case` OF g, TRUE, lic, d, FALSE

`apply` MEANS `applying the design to an article`
`import` MEANS `importing for sale or trade an article to which the design was applied outside Australia`

#ASSERT `I infringe the monopoly` (`a trader` `apply` `licensed` FALSE `on` (Date 13 10 1983))
#ASSERT `I infringe the monopoly` (`a trader` `apply` `licensed` FALSE `on` (Date 12 10 1999))
#ASSERT NOT (`I infringe the monopoly` (`a trader` `apply` `licensed` FALSE `on` (Date 13 10 1999)))
#ASSERT NOT (`I infringe the monopoly` (`a trader` `apply` `licensed` FALSE `on` (Date 12 10 1983)))
#ASSERT NOT (`I infringe the monopoly` (`a trader` `apply` `licensed` TRUE `on` (Date 1 1 1990)))
#ASSERT NOT (`I infringe the monopoly` (`a trader` `selling or hiring an article to which the design was applied in infringement` `licensed` TRUE `on` (Date 1 1 1990)))
-- s 11(1)(c), (d): no licence words.
#ASSERT `I infringe the monopoly` (`a trader` `import` `licensed` TRUE `on` (Date 1 1 1990))
#ASSERT `I infringe the monopoly` (`a trader` `selling or hiring an imported article bearing the design` `licensed` FALSE `on` (Date 1 1 1990))
-- neither the design nor an imitation
#ASSERT NOT (`I infringe the monopoly` (`Logo case` OF `apply`, FALSE, FALSE, Date 1 1 1990, FALSE))
-- s 19
#ASSERT `do I infringe the copyright` (`a trader` `apply` `licensed` FALSE `on` (Date 1 1 1990)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `do I infringe the copyright` (`a trader` `apply` `licensed` FALSE `on` (Date 1 1 2020)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `do I infringe the copyright` (`a trader` `apply` `licensed` FALSE `on` (Date 1 1 1983)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 15(2)
#ASSERT `no action lies` (`Logo case` OF `apply`, TRUE, FALSE, Date 1 1 1983, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`no action lies` (`Logo case` OF `apply`, TRUE, FALSE, Date 1 1 1983, FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`no action lies` (`Logo case` OF `apply`, TRUE, FALSE, Date 13 10 1983, TRUE))
